checked_add(INT_MAX, 1) = 0
channels(stereo) = 2
average = 6
</code></pre> <p>Because signed overflow is UB, the compiler may assume <code>x + 1 &gt; x</code> is always true and delete your overflow check. That's not a compiler bug; it's the contract you signed.</p>

