</code></pre> <p>Each block is the C++23 workaround for a C++26 feature: manual field lists (→ reflection), an assert macro (→ contracts), <code>std::array</code> + size (→ <code>inplace_vector</code>), <code>std::tuple_element</code> (→ pack indexing), <code>std::add_sat</code> emulation (→ saturating arithmetic).</p>
